---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/global/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/global/Button.astro';
import CardGrid from '../components/sections/CardGrid.astro';
import InfoCard from '../components/sections/InfoCard.astro';
import ImageGallery from '../components/sections/ImageGallery.astro';

const registerUrl = 'https://connect.intuit.com/pay/WayfindersOnTheHudson/scs-v1-3ef6531ada3d487b898212099c1dcf992a1795b6d4c24ce9acec1b23f8c3f88478a340b7890448bbb12595742a93316e?locale=EN_US&cta=copylistmultilink';
const commerceUrl = 'https://www.wayfindersonthehudson.com/register-for-fall-2023/p/autumn-2026-womens-retreat';
---
<BaseLayout title="Autumn 2026 Women's Retreat" description="Autumn 2026 Women’s Retreat at Lenoir Preserve in Yonkers.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Friday, September 18th" title="Autumn 2026 Women’s Retreat" intro="It's hard to feel it right now, while it's still summertime and the light is showing us everything we need to see, but as the days darken this fall, will you be prepared to keep holding your medicine—what has been shown to you in this clear and bright light?" image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61532ef9082b334755993cfd/2747a8bf-7a1a-4a91-8295-fc9faf882066/IMG_3736.jpg?format=1200w" alt="A group gathered outdoors at a Wayfinders retreat">
  <Button href={commerceUrl}>Autumn 2026 Women's Retreat</Button>
</PageHero>
<Section width="wide"><CardGrid columns={3}><InfoCard label="DATE" heading="Friday, September 18th" headingLevel="h2"><p>TIME: 1:30–5:30 PM</p></InfoCard><InfoCard label="LOCATION" heading="Lenoir Preserve in Yonkers" headingLevel="h2" /><InfoCard label="COST" heading="$120" headingLevel="h2"><p>Scholarships and payment plans are available, so please don't hesitate to reach out. We would love to have you with us!</p></InfoCard></CardGrid></Section>
<Section tone="alternate" width="wide"><div class="intro"><p>We are here to hold you through this moment together. Join us to gather around the fire with other women as we downshift into quieter times. We will reflect on summer to keep the vibes flying, and set intentions for keeping the thread alive as we enter into autumn.</p><p><strong>Spots intentionally limited</strong></p></div><CardGrid columns={3}><InfoCard heading="Retreat Tracks" headingLevel="h2"><p>Select one of the following tracks:</p><ul><li>Family of Origin</li><li>Ancient Goddess Cultures: What our Grandmothers Knew About Culture Creation</li><li>Intro to Vision Quest</li></ul></InfoCard><InfoCard heading="What's Included" headingLevel="h2"><ul><li>Fire Circle and Facilitation</li><li>Snacks and Tea (local & seasonal)</li><li>Guided wellness treatments & meditations</li><li>Supplies for all activities</li><li>Ample time for rest & reflection</li></ul></InfoCard><InfoCard heading="Possibilities" headingLevel="h2"><ul><li>Sistering</li><li>Ceremony</li><li>Relational rigor</li><li>Rest</li><li>Engagement with the land</li><li>Forest Yoga</li></ul></InfoCard></CardGrid><div class="supporting-images"><ImageGallery><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61532ef9082b334755993cfd/1784832708689-L449LUNVPMZHPOMK2PFE/unsplash-image-3pFOBqLirEU.jpg?format=1200w" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61532ef9082b334755993cfd/1784843341023-SKQCOSDA526I4FEP3XCZ/unsplash-image-pYTTHwL2UjI.jpg?format=1200w" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" /></ImageGallery></div></Section>
<Section width="wide"><p class="type-label">How It Works</p><div class="steps"><article><span>1</span><h2 class="type-card">Reserve Your Spot</h2><p>Sign up to reserve your spot.</p></article><article><span>2</span><h2 class="type-card">Review the Welcome Email</h2><p>After registering, we'll send you a Welcome Email with everything you need to know.</p></article><article><span>3</span><h2 class="type-card">Start Dreaming</h2><p>Get excited for our adventure; we can’t wait to be together in restoration.</p></article></div><Button href={registerUrl}>Register</Button></Section></BaseLayout>
<style>:global(.page-hero .button){margin-top:2rem}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.steps article{padding:var(--card-padding);border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:var(--color-surface)}.steps h2{margin:0}.steps p,.intro p{color:var(--color-ink-muted)}.intro{max-width:var(--width-prose);margin-bottom:2rem}.steps{margin:1rem 0 2rem}.steps span{display:grid;width:2.5rem;aspect-ratio:1;place-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-cream);font-weight:800}.supporting-images{margin-top:2rem}@media(max-width:47.999rem){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
